---
/* Code block: scrolls sideways inside its own box and can be focused so it scrolls from the keyboard. Code stays LTR.
   The box around it draws a fade at the end edge while there is more to the right (blog.css, .post-code-box). */
---
<div class="post-code-box"><pre class="post-code" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" lang="en"><slot /></pre></div>
